      "reference_runs": [
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text": "D.C. resident challenges policy of private vehicle seizure without providing prompt post-deprivation hearing (D.D.C.)",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text": "D.C.住民が、速やかな事後審理を設けずに私有車を押収する方針を争う（D.C.連邦地裁）。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 10,
          "text": "Plaintiffs sue Sprint for age discrimination; 1,697-member class wins $57 million settlement (D. Kan.) ",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 11,
          "text": "原告らが年齢差別でSprintを訴え、1,697人の集団が5,700万ドルの和解を得る（カンザス連邦地裁）。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 12,
          "text": "A class action lawsuit was filed against a company after Cuban-born Americans were denied a ticket to Cuba.",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 13,
          "text": "キューバ生まれの米国人がキューバ行きの乗船券を拒否された後、その会社を相手に集団訴訟が提起された。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 36,
          "text": "Added to the Clearinghouse: Lawsuit filed by @AbolitionistLC in 2020 alleging that the Pittsburgh police violated non-violent protestors First and Fourth Amendment rights.",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 37,
          "text": "Clearinghouseに追加：@AbolitionistLCが2020年に提起し、ピッツバーグ警察による非暴力の抗議参加者の修正第1条・第4条の権利侵害を訴えた事件。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 38,
          "text": "This is a case brought by the Protect Democracy Project, seeking disclosure of records on the extent to which defendants cooperate with armed private militia groups along the U.S.-Mexico border",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 39,
          "text": "Protect Democracy Projectが、米墨国境の武装民兵組織と被告機関の協力の程度を示す記録の公開を求めた事件。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 40,
          "text": "In E.D. Ohio case, plaintiffs secure preliminary injunction to prevent police from using excessive force against non-violent protestors. In granting the injunction, Judge Marbley recounted how \"formal policing took its earliest form in slave patrols.\"",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 41,
          "text": "E.D. Ohioの事件で、非暴力の抗議参加者への過剰な実力行使を禁じる仮差止めを原告らが得た。Marbley判事は命令に際し「制度としての警察活動は、奴隷巡察隊という形で最初に現れた」と述べた。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 42,
          "text": "EEOC brought claim of retaliatory discharge against Bright Petroleum in December 2013. Parties reached a consent decree in 2014 (S.D. Ind.)",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 43,
          "text": "雇用機会均等委員会が2013年12月にBright Petroleumを報復的解雇で訴え、2014年に同意判決へ到達した（インディアナ南部地区）。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 44,
          "text": "In this case, the James Madison Project and the news website The Daily Beast sought disclosure of agency records related to the implementation of President Trump's Jan. 27, 2017 Executive Order",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 45,
          "text": "James Madison ProjectとDaily Beastが、トランプ大統領の2017年1月27日の大統領令の実施に関する記録の公開を求めた事件。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 46,
          "text": "Final updates on @ACLUVA, @ACLU_MD, @aclupa, and @ACLUDeleware lawsuit against @DHSgov demanding document production re the Muslim Ban. Plaintiffs brought the suit under FOIA in 2017.",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 47,
          "text": "@ACLUVA、@ACLU_MD、@aclupa、@ACLUDelewareがイスラム教徒の入国禁止に関する資料の提出を@DHSgovへ求めた訴訟の最終更新。原告らは2017年に情報自由法に基づき提訴した。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 48,
          "text": "Just added to the Clearinghouse: One of @CivRightsCorps cases focusing on criminalization of poverty. This case involves an alleged wealth-based detention scheme in Tulsa County, Oklahoma.",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 49,
          "text": "Clearinghouseに追加：貧困の犯罪化を扱う@CivRightsCorpsの事件の一つ。オクラホマ州タルサ郡の資力に基づく勾留制度が争われている。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 50,
          "text": "Princeton sues DOE in reverse FOIA action to stop disclosure. (D.D.C.) ",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 51,
          "text": "Princetonが、資料公開を止めるため逆情報自由法訴訟で教育省を訴える（D.C.連邦地裁）。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 52,
          "text": "Documents now posted for Maryland litigation brought on behalf of ICE detainees seeking release from detention due to COVID-19",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 53,
          "text": "COVID-19を理由に拘束からの解放を求める移民・税関捜査局の被収容者のために提起された、メリーランド州の訴訟資料を掲載。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 54,
          "text": "Just added to the Clearinghouse - @NAACP sued the city of San Jose for allegedly unconstitutional police practices being used against peaceful protestors.",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        },
        {
          "page": 55,
          "text": "Clearinghouseに追加：平和的な抗議参加者に対する違憲とされる警察活動をめぐり、@NAACPがサンノゼ市を訴えた。",
          "size_pt": 21,
          "bold": true,
          "color": "B13731"
        }
